{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"'It is. My Guide spied on the Redcoats guarding it, and they plan to attack tomorrow. To quote one of them, and please forgive my language as I'm quoting them directly, the machine gives them the `ability to cut through the fog and crush those nature bitches once and for all`.'","created_at":"2021-08-18T10:33:15.568000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877500387580579881","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
