{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Well, it begins with what I was told by Roy and Sab. They said there's a machine that's creating some sort of storm. Well shorting it out could be tricky cuz it's already conducting electricity.\n \nThat got me thinking well, I don't want it to be simply unleashed and destroyed that could be dangerous. Then I thought about the 13 casks of Molasses I was going to use for some of Fuddles' waffles, they're delicious. But hey, sticky bomb? That could be explosive and gunk up a machine stopping it from working properly.\n\nAdd a few reactants and shabang, I've done the thing. \"","created_at":"2021-08-19T00:37:17.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877712794919792700","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
